cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite it as below. The associated journal article is pending."
type: software
title: "ugv-energy-aware-dispatch: Reproducibility package for 'When does energy-aware online dispatch save energy?'"
abstract: >-
  Frozen simulator, prespecified protocols, experiment code, complete campaign archives (14,013 validated simulation
  runs), analysis tables and verification scripts for a matched-seed study of energy-aware online vehicle-request
  assignment in an electric ride-pooling fleet.
authors:
